  "description": "<p>BatchModifyParser was modeled after an earlier version of METSDODeserializer parser which has since been updated and streamlined. BatchModifyParser does not currently reflect these same updates.</p>\n\n<p>It is desirable to update BatchModifyParser to reflect similar changes made to other parsers in regards to handling of in-line xml content and namespace handling for consistency.</p>",
